#: ../../source/docs/common-dshot-escs.rst:9
#: 32087d7b60d84234831db93f3bf81cb2
msgid "DShot is a digital ESC protocol which allows fast, high resolution digital communication which may improve vehicle control which is especially useful in multirotor and quadplane applications.  Other advantages include"
